  "notes": "USAGE NOTE:\nA clinical, neutral term used in medical and health contexts. In everyday conversation, {太|ふと}りすぎ or {太|ふと}っている is more common. {肥満|ひまん} does not carry the offensive connotation of informal words like デブ.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {肥満|ひまん}{体型|たいけい} (obese body type)\n- {肥満|ひまん}{予防|よぼう} (obesity prevention)\n- {肥満|ひまん}{解消|かいしょう} (eliminating obesity)\n- {肥満|ひまん}{度|ど} (degree of obesity)\n- {肥満|ひまん}{児|じ} (obese child)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {太|ふと}りすぎ: being too fat (casual, everyday term)\n- メタボ: metabolic syndrome (colloquial abbreviation of メタボリックシンドローム)",
